_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3211850886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109226#issuecomment-3211850886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109226","id":3211850886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_cPSG","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T19:39:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T19:39:18Z","body":"Looks like this is because of the `mousedown` -> `pointerdown` swap. From the `pointerdown` [MDN docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/pointerdown_event):\n\n> This behavior is different from [mousedown](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/mousedown_event) events. When using a physical mouse, mousedown events fire whenever any button on a mouse is pressed down. pointerdown events fire only upon the first button press; subsequent button presses don't fire pointerdown events.\n\nSounds like we should probably be handling both?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine